      "biography": {
        "value": "<h2>Description</h2><p>Sinspawn are presumably fiends that are formed by outlets of the multitude of pyreflies that composes Sin's physical form. Collectively, the forms of Sinspawn coincide with those of reef-dwelling creatures, such as anemones and jellyfish. - DMLeibfrid</p><h2>Defense</h2><p>AC 18, touch 13, flat-footed 13 (-2 size, +5 Dex, +5 natural)</p><p>hp 70 [105] (7d8+49)</p><p>Fort +10, Ref +8, Will +10</p><p>Immune Antagonized, Disable, Death, Petrification/Statue, Poison, Sleep, Zombie</p><h2>Offense</h2><p>Speed Swim 40 ft., Fly 20 ft.</p><p>Melee 2 Tentacles +7 (2d6+6 plus bleed)</p><p>Space 15 ft.; Reach 15 ft.</p><p>Special Attacks Blender, Drain Touch</p><h2>Statistics</h2><p>Str 22, Dex 20, Con 24, Int 4, Wis 18, Cha 12</p><p>Base Atk +6; CMB +14; CMD 29</p><p>Feats Cleave, Hover, Power Attack, Weapon Focus (Tentacle)</p><p>Skills Fly +8, Swim +14</p><h2>Ecology</h2><p>Organization solitary</p>"
